# Goose AI Project Guidelines & Constraints (.goosehints)

## Architecture & Frameworks
- Frontend: React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4, Motion (framer-motion v12).
- 3D Engine: Three.js loaded dynamically via `src/components/threeUtils.ts` (Fast Refresh safe).
- Backend: Express on Node with Vite HMR integration (`server.ts`).
- Production Port: 3000.

## Quality & Design Standards
- Strictly enforce `DESIGN.md` tokens (Apple high-key `#F5F5F7`, `#1D1D1F`, Airbnb `#FF385C`).
- Enforce the 8px grid layout scale.
- Copy must maintain Apple Keynote brevity (<20 words per subhead).
- Avoid AI slop: no purple-cyan neon gradients, no card-in-card clutter, no low-contrast text.

## Commands
- Build verification: `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`) and `npm run build`.
- Local development: `npm run dev`.
